WEBVTT

00:00:02.005 --> 00:00:05.805
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.276 --> 00:00:10.076
Delivers this message

00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:19.080
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.223 --> 00:00:20.757
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.757 --> 00:00:28.798
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:29.093
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:36.602
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:40.970
But please don't look back

00:00:41.111 --> 00:00:45.138
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.348 --> 00:00:49.444
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:53.155
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:57.325
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.727 --> 00:01:01.458
Delivers this message

00:01:01.898 --> 00:01:10.067
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:18.643
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.082 --> 00:01:28.753
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:32.762 --> 00:01:35.629
One month has passed
since Shurei entered the palace.

00:01:36.933 --> 00:01:39.493
In accordance with
his promise to Shurei...

00:01:40.136 --> 00:01:40.570
...Ryuki attends the morning
court sessions without fail.

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.306
Ryuki Shi
...Ryuki attends the morning
court sessions without fail.

00:01:43.306 --> 00:01:43.601
...Ryuki attends the morning
court sessions without fail.

00:01:44.908 --> 00:01:47.035
And in the afternoons...

00:01:47.143 --> 00:01:52.137
...it has become routine for him
to attend Koyu's lessons with Shurei.

00:01:53.817 --> 00:01:56.650
Well then,
let's stop there for today.

00:01:56.853 --> 00:01:57.979
Sure.

00:01:58.321 --> 00:02:00.289
Thank you very much.

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:03.926
Say, what was the main issue
in court this morning?

00:02:04.327 --> 00:02:07.296
This morning we discussed
our lack of tax revenue.

00:02:07.397 --> 00:02:09.422
Lack of tax revenue?

00:02:09.566 --> 00:02:12.797
It's only been eight years since the
chaos over the struggle for the throne.

00:02:13.102 --> 00:02:17.630
The country has not yet stabilized,
so we can't expect to collect much tax.

00:02:17.974 --> 00:02:21.501
However, without enough money,
we cannot run the country.

00:02:21.578 --> 00:02:24.206
A suggestion was put forward
to increase taxes a little...!

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.009
You can't do that!

00:02:26.082 --> 00:02:29.245
How can you burden the people
of this country even further?!

00:02:29.319 --> 00:02:32.686
First and foremost you should think
about how to make the people wealthy.

00:02:32.956 --> 00:02:35.982
If you do that, then even if you
collect tax at the same rate...

00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.093
...your tax revenue
will increase, right?

00:02:38.928 --> 00:02:43.160
That's true. If the state of the economy
improves, tax revenue will increase.

00:02:43.633 --> 00:02:46.796
To have the foresight
to think ahead ten, twenty years...

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.701
...is quite impressive, indeed.

00:02:49.138 --> 00:02:52.198
It would be great if you could take
the National Exams as well, Shurei.

00:02:54.811 --> 00:02:56.438
Yes, it would.

00:02:56.512 --> 00:03:01.472
A Capable Hawk Hides Its Talons

00:03:06.589 --> 00:03:08.989
Brother. Why?

00:03:10.293 --> 00:03:12.227
Don't go, brother!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.967
S-Seiran.

00:03:19.335 --> 00:03:21.132
I'm sorry for the intrusion.

00:03:21.204 --> 00:03:22.762
You seemed distressed
having a nightmare...

00:03:22.839 --> 00:03:24.739
...so I entered
without permission.

00:03:25.041 --> 00:03:26.508
I see.

00:03:29.445 --> 00:03:32.243
Ah... You reached out,
so I instinctively...!

00:03:34.851 --> 00:03:37.183
Want to sleep
with me tonight, Seiran?

00:03:38.121 --> 00:03:42.114
N-No. People have
different tastes, and...!

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:45.759
I was joking.

00:03:52.168 --> 00:03:53.430
Is something wrong?

00:03:53.503 --> 00:03:57.098
You're... much too fine a man,
don't you think?

00:03:57.774 --> 00:04:03.770
Well, I feel that Shurei relies
more on you than she does me.

00:04:03.846 --> 00:04:07.009
You have been living with her for
so long, and I can understand that.

00:04:08.718 --> 00:04:13.382
But as Shurei's husband, I must say
it sometimes upsets me a little.

00:04:15.158 --> 00:04:17.092
All right,
I've made a decision.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.890
Starting now, I will bridge the gap
between my wife and I.

00:04:21.164 --> 00:04:23.064
You won't need
to stand guard tonight.

00:04:23.132 --> 00:04:26.533
P-Please wait a moment!
You'll catch a cold dressed like that.

00:04:26.602 --> 00:04:29.162
The nights are still chilly. Won't you
wear something more than that?

00:04:29.706 --> 00:04:32.971
I like Shurei,
but I like you too, Seiran.

00:04:38.114 --> 00:04:40.912
Shisui, what did you just say?

00:04:41.484 --> 00:04:42.974
Consort Shurei, as a couple...

00:04:43.052 --> 00:04:45.646
...you and the king always
seem to get along so well.

00:04:45.755 --> 00:04:48.451
So why do you continue
to sleep separately at night?

00:04:48.958 --> 00:04:51.119
Everyone finds it strange.

00:04:52.228 --> 00:04:54.196
But that's...!

00:04:54.964 --> 00:04:57.228
Consort Shurei, are you all right?

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.859
I'll get the medicine box
right away.

00:05:02.405 --> 00:05:08.275
The king prefers men. Isn't it natural
for him not to come to my room?

00:05:08.778 --> 00:05:11.645
Do you really believe that?

00:05:11.948 --> 00:05:15.406
Think about it.
When Seiran and I are together...

00:05:15.485 --> 00:05:17.976
...the king is always
staring at Seiran.

00:05:19.322 --> 00:05:21.586
That must mean
he has feelings for Seiran.

00:05:21.657 --> 00:05:25.115
Consort Shurei,
you're just oblivious. Right?

00:05:25.395 --> 00:05:28.853
Yes. There, I'm done.

00:05:29.499 --> 00:05:30.761
Thank you.

00:05:30.833 --> 00:05:34.234
The king cherishes you very much,
Consort Shurei.

00:05:34.704 --> 00:05:38.265
I'm sure he just wants to take his time
to nurture this love with you.

00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:42.072
But we hope to see a royal heir
before too long.

00:05:42.879 --> 00:05:46.940
We plan to make the necessary
preparations for you.

00:05:47.683 --> 00:05:50.208
P-P-Preparations?!
What for?!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.982
I-I appreciate your thoughtfulness.

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:56.385
But this kind of thing...
Yes, that's it.

00:05:56.459 --> 00:05:59.428
Let's just allow
nature to take its course.

00:05:59.495 --> 00:06:00.962
Really?

00:06:04.067 --> 00:06:09.300
How beautiful. Consort Shurei,
you really are good at everything.

00:06:09.872 --> 00:06:11.840
Y-You think so?

00:06:12.241 --> 00:06:13.936
I'm only good with needlework...

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.841
...because I've had to repair
old clothes day after day.

00:06:15.912 --> 00:06:17.846
Of course I'd be good at it.

00:06:17.947 --> 00:06:20.177
I'm lousy with needlework.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.982
Then why don't I teach you?

00:06:23.319 --> 00:06:25.048
Will you really?!

00:06:25.254 --> 00:06:28.849
Oh? Is there somebody who you'd
like to give your needlework to?

00:06:29.258 --> 00:06:32.421
That person who always
sends you letters, right?

00:06:32.895 --> 00:06:34.453
Yes.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:38.523
He must be someone very
important to you. I'm so envious.

00:06:38.801 --> 00:06:42.328
But you have the king,
Consort Shurei.

00:06:42.905 --> 00:06:47.933
Well, yes...
Oh, Shusui, won't you join us?

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:51.002
I'm not too fond of needlework.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.981
So even you have something
you're not too good at.

00:06:54.183 --> 00:06:56.879
I was adopted,
in a sense...

00:06:56.986 --> 00:07:01.082
...so I've learned manners and etiquette,
but this kind of thing...!

00:07:01.691 --> 00:07:06.094
I see. But even so, to be brought
to work in the Royal Harem...

00:07:06.162 --> 00:07:08.130
...he must've thought
very highly of you.

00:07:08.197 --> 00:07:09.164
Yes.

00:07:09.432 --> 00:07:13.198
He is a very important
person to me.

00:07:13.736 --> 00:07:15.328
Who is that?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.367
Come on,
it's getting late.

00:07:19.509 --> 00:07:21.841
You can learn
how to embroider tomorrow.

00:07:21.911 --> 00:07:23.139
I suggest you excuse yourself.

00:07:23.212 --> 00:07:26.909
Yes. Well then I wish you
good night.

00:07:27.216 --> 00:07:29.184
Yes. Good night.

00:07:31.854 --> 00:07:34.755
Well then,
I'll be leaving as well.

00:07:35.024 --> 00:07:36.992
Yes. Thank you
for your hard work.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.263
Th-This is serious!

00:07:42.331 --> 00:07:44.128
Where are your manners?!

00:07:45.301 --> 00:07:48.930
- The king is on his way here!
- What?! The king?!

00:07:50.606 --> 00:07:52.767
What are you doing here
so late at night?

00:07:52.909 --> 00:07:54.877
I'm here to bridge the gap.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:58.677
Those...!

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:02.709
Are they by chance for me?

00:08:04.086 --> 00:08:07.522
Oh, no! Don't tell me you picked them
with your bare hands!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.558
Your hands are all scratched up!

00:08:09.926 --> 00:08:12.121
And they're so cold.

00:08:12.728 --> 00:08:15.253
That's because you've been wandering
around with next to nothing on.

00:08:15.364 --> 00:08:17.332
Hurry up and come in.

00:08:25.441 --> 00:08:27.033
Pink roses...!

00:08:27.109 --> 00:08:30.909
Oh, Seiran picked them
this afternoon.

00:08:31.414 --> 00:08:32.745
Seiran.

00:08:33.482 --> 00:08:35.916
- Here, show me your hands.
- Right.

00:08:35.985 --> 00:08:40.046
Goodness. Didn't it hurt picking roses
with your bare hands?

00:08:40.456 --> 00:08:41.548
Not really.

00:08:43.426 --> 00:08:46.884
These hands...
They're callused and thick skinned.

00:08:47.863 --> 00:08:50.195
Do you practice swordsmanship?

00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:53.427
As a part of my royal training,
I learned a little.

00:08:53.536 --> 00:08:56.562
Really? They look like
Seiran's hands.

00:08:57.373 --> 00:08:58.840
Shurei.

00:08:59.909 --> 00:09:01.900
From now on,
call me by my name!

00:09:03.212 --> 00:09:05.180
I want you to call me
by my name!

00:09:05.248 --> 00:09:07.443
Wh-What's this all
of a sudden?

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.742
I'm the only one you don't call by name.
It's not fair!

00:09:10.886 --> 00:09:13.480
It's not an issue of what's fair or not,
but rather...!

00:09:15.358 --> 00:09:17.326
Ryuki. Like that?

00:09:21.964 --> 00:09:25.923
I understand.
But only when we're alone, okay?

00:09:28.971 --> 00:09:30.268
Sorry!

00:09:30.339 --> 00:09:33.604
Why do roses have thorns?

00:09:34.076 --> 00:09:37.341
It's because the Rose Princess
fell in love with a human, right?

00:09:38.114 --> 00:09:42.414
- Where'd you come up with that?
- Don't you know it? It's a fairytale.

00:09:43.085 --> 00:09:46.953
I don't know it. No one's ever
told me that story before.

00:09:49.425 --> 00:09:51.052
Once upon a time...

00:09:51.127 --> 00:09:54.619
...there was a very beautiful princess
called the Rose Princess.

00:09:55.698 --> 00:10:00.192
She had the amazing power to heal
all injuries and cure any illness.

00:10:01.304 --> 00:10:03.932
So many people asked
for her hand in marriage.

00:10:10.046 --> 00:10:11.911
You're hopeless.

00:10:16.085 --> 00:10:18.747
Now then,
where should I sleep?

00:10:19.955 --> 00:10:22.253
He likes men...

00:10:22.591 --> 00:10:26.425
...so he's not gonna
try anything weird, right?

00:10:27.029 --> 00:10:29.156
Well, just in case.

00:10:33.903 --> 00:10:35.803
Good night.

00:10:43.045 --> 00:10:45.775
Consort Shurei,
Good morn...

00:10:47.149 --> 00:10:49.208
I-I'm terribly sorry!

00:10:57.827 --> 00:11:02.855
Wh-What the...! Your Majesty!
Wake up! Let go of me!

00:11:04.233 --> 00:11:06.565
I told you,
call me by my name.

00:11:07.036 --> 00:11:11.564
No way! Wake up! Wake up now!
I said wake up!!

00:11:12.041 --> 00:11:17.001
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:19.782 --> 00:11:23.479
I hear the king and Consort Shurei
finally shared the same bed!

00:11:23.552 --> 00:11:24.780
Oh, really?

00:11:24.854 --> 00:11:28.017
Yes. Someone actually saw it
with their own eyes!

00:11:28.457 --> 00:11:31.483
- Well then, if that's the case...!
- It's cause for celebration!

00:11:34.463 --> 00:11:36.431
Have you heard, Koyu?

00:11:36.599 --> 00:11:40.000
About the king and Shurei?
I'm not interested.

00:11:40.403 --> 00:11:42.564
What's wrong?
You're in a bad mood.

00:11:43.205 --> 00:11:45.901
You knew that the king was
just pretending to be stupid...

00:11:45.975 --> 00:11:48.136
...from the very beginning,
didn't you?

00:11:48.744 --> 00:11:52.805
- Why didn't you say anything?
- You still noticed without me telling you.

00:11:53.449 --> 00:11:57.749
Well, yeah. It's impossible
to learn so much in so little time.

00:11:58.220 --> 00:12:02.623
No one can learn in a few months
what I've spent years learning!

00:12:03.192 --> 00:12:06.355
"A capable falcon hides
its talons," right?

00:12:07.563 --> 00:12:09.758
Still, no matter how talented
a person is...

00:12:09.832 --> 00:12:11.060
...if he doesn't
use those talents...

00:12:11.133 --> 00:12:13.465
...he's no different than
an untalented person.

00:12:14.069 --> 00:12:17.129
As king, he must do his best
to fulfill his responsibilities.

00:12:17.773 --> 00:12:22.506
But if he makes no attempt to,
he's still the same spoiled, stupid king.

00:12:23.345 --> 00:12:27.805
You're telling me this because
you think there's still hope for him?

00:12:28.784 --> 00:12:30.445
I guess so.

00:12:30.519 --> 00:12:35.479
Thanks to Shurei, well, things have
become a bit more interesting.

00:12:36.025 --> 00:12:39.461
If she finds out that the king is only
pretending to be stupid...

00:12:39.962 --> 00:12:42.590
...how do you think Shurei
will react?

00:12:43.165 --> 00:12:45.326
She'll be incredibly angry,
I assume.

00:12:48.037 --> 00:12:49.766
Serves him right.

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:55.809
Gimme a break.

00:12:56.712 --> 00:12:59.340
What are you doing showing up
here again so casually?

00:12:59.448 --> 00:13:02.645
I came to hear the rest of yesterday's
Rose Princess story!

00:13:03.486 --> 00:13:05.477
You're planning
to sleep here again, right?

00:13:06.956 --> 00:13:10.824
All right, then.
I'll just have to accept it.

00:13:11.494 --> 00:13:13.758
We can't erase a rumor
that's already spread.

00:13:13.829 --> 00:13:16.798
One night or two nights
isn't gonna make a difference.

00:13:19.268 --> 00:13:20.701
Where did you get that?

00:13:20.769 --> 00:13:26.173
Oh, father gave them to me.
He said his younger brother sent them.

00:13:27.376 --> 00:13:29.674
They're pure silver.
Beautiful, aren't they?

00:13:31.514 --> 00:13:32.845
What's the matter?

00:13:35.251 --> 00:13:36.513
Nothing.

00:13:38.621 --> 00:13:40.282
Oh, right!

00:13:43.859 --> 00:13:45.349
This is for you.

00:13:45.794 --> 00:13:48.854
For me?!
You made this, Shurei?

00:13:49.765 --> 00:13:53.360
Well, it's not like that pattern
appeared on its own, so I guess so.

00:13:53.903 --> 00:13:57.964
This is the first time
anyone has ever given me anything.

00:13:59.909 --> 00:14:03.436
I seldom do embroidery,
so consider it valuable.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.804
Not even for Seiran?

00:14:06.482 --> 00:14:08.575
Doesn't Seiran
have one of these?

00:14:09.151 --> 00:14:14.646
I guess not. I've mended his clothes,
but never done any embroidery for him.

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:16.548
I see.

00:14:25.935 --> 00:14:30.065
Oh? A handmade gift
from Shurei?

00:14:30.706 --> 00:14:31.673
Yes.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:34.402
She's quite talented
with her hands, isn't she?

00:14:35.444 --> 00:14:39.904
Might I suggest you give her
a gift in return, Your Majesty?

00:14:40.482 --> 00:14:43.451
That certainly would make
Shurei very happy.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:45.910
A gift?

00:14:51.727 --> 00:14:54.890
At any rate, the king sure looks
more like a ruler now, doesn't he?

00:14:54.964 --> 00:14:57.558
Marriage certainly
does change a man.

00:14:57.633 --> 00:15:01.364
He's also been participating
in court discussions of late.

00:15:02.104 --> 00:15:05.369
This really is all
thanks to Consort Shurei.

00:15:06.742 --> 00:15:10.439
He retains a dignified presence,
even before the provincial governors.

00:15:12.581 --> 00:15:15.448
Here, Your Majesty.
Allow me to pour some wine for you.

00:15:22.257 --> 00:15:24.384
Now then,
for Consort Shurei as well.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.427
Yes.

00:15:26.562 --> 00:15:27.961
It's empty already.

00:15:29.465 --> 00:15:31.126
More wine over here!

00:15:31.734 --> 00:15:33.292
Yes, right away.

00:15:40.676 --> 00:15:42.268
There you are.

00:15:42.344 --> 00:15:45.472
Y-Yes. Thank you very much.

00:15:50.319 --> 00:15:51.616
Your Majesty!

00:16:01.163 --> 00:16:05.998
Consort Shurei doesn't drink much.
Allow me to drink this on her behalf.

00:16:09.605 --> 00:16:12.938
Oh, how impressive!
I'm awestruck.

00:16:15.477 --> 00:16:18.207
My, what's happened to you?

00:16:18.981 --> 00:16:21.541
Did that small amount of wine
really make you this drunk?

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.618
Yeah, perhaps.

00:16:24.253 --> 00:16:26.881
Anyway, I'm taking you to my room.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.552
Your Majesty.

00:16:32.628 --> 00:16:33.925
Seiran?

00:16:34.129 --> 00:16:36.495
You've been poisoned!

00:16:36.899 --> 00:16:39.026
Poisoned? Then that...!

00:16:42.137 --> 00:16:45.698
That's right. You're the one
it was intended for.

00:16:47.109 --> 00:16:51.546
If you knew, then why did you drink it?!
You should've thrown that wine away!

00:16:52.047 --> 00:16:56.279
Rejecting wine poured by others
at a banquet is incredibly rude.

00:16:57.052 --> 00:16:59.714
If he or the consort had
done such a thing...

00:17:00.122 --> 00:17:02.249
...it would have given rise
to unnecessary speculation.

00:17:02.324 --> 00:17:06.226
Even so... Wait a moment.
I'll go get the doctor!

00:17:06.295 --> 00:17:09.890
Don't! That'll make matters worse.

00:17:10.299 --> 00:17:11.391
But...!

00:17:12.034 --> 00:17:15.595
I'm all right.
It wasn't a strong poison.

00:17:16.705 --> 00:17:18.832
It probably wasn't intended
to kill you.

00:17:19.808 --> 00:17:23.767
I just need a good night's sleep, and I
should be feeling better in the morning.

00:17:23.946 --> 00:17:26.574
Seiran, you may leave.

00:17:27.816 --> 00:17:29.181
Yes.

00:17:29.551 --> 00:17:31.109
And me?

00:17:31.186 --> 00:17:33.154
Please stay here.

00:17:36.191 --> 00:17:37.920
I hate the dark.

00:17:39.161 --> 00:17:41.823
Being alone in the dark.
I hate it.

00:17:42.598 --> 00:17:43.997
Why is that?

00:17:44.066 --> 00:17:48.469
Long ago, I was often
locked up in a dark place.

00:17:49.438 --> 00:17:50.598
By whom?

00:17:50.939 --> 00:17:53.373
My mother and brothers.

00:17:53.442 --> 00:17:54.773
What do you mean?

00:17:55.144 --> 00:17:57.442
Because I was
an unwanted child.

00:17:58.747 --> 00:18:01.409
My birth came at a bad time,
it seems.

00:18:02.551 --> 00:18:04.644
I was the youngest brother...

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:06.950
...so my father's love was spread thin...
was pale in comparison.

00:18:07.589 --> 00:18:09.614
My mother always blamed me
and was angry with me.

00:18:10.292 --> 00:18:12.260
I was completely neglected.

00:18:12.861 --> 00:18:15.193
All I remember is the fear
and anxiety I felt...

00:18:15.264 --> 00:18:17.994
...when I was locked in
that storeroom for days on end.

00:18:18.066 --> 00:18:21.126
My brothers didn't treat me
well either.

00:18:22.004 --> 00:18:25.098
I was the youngest,
so I was often overlooked.

00:18:25.841 --> 00:18:27.069
I was kicked and beaten...

00:18:27.142 --> 00:18:29.940
...and treated like the perfect object
to vent their frustrations against.

00:18:30.479 --> 00:18:32.071
How could they do such things?

00:18:32.147 --> 00:18:36.481
But in spite of this, I was fine as long as
my big brother Seien was there for me.

00:18:36.785 --> 00:18:38.082
Seien?

00:18:38.487 --> 00:18:40.648
My second eldest brother.

00:18:41.523 --> 00:18:44.959
My big brother taught me
literacy and math.

00:18:45.594 --> 00:18:48.461
When my other brothers would beat me,
he would treat my wounds.

00:18:49.097 --> 00:18:51.156
Isn't your second eldest...?

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:56.362
Yeah. When I was six years old,
he was exiled.

00:18:57.306 --> 00:19:02.107
I couldn't stop crying.
It was around then that I met Shoka.

00:19:02.511 --> 00:19:03.671
Father?

00:19:04.913 --> 00:19:07.711
When I went to the archives,
I was no longer alone.

00:19:08.383 --> 00:19:11.011
But even so,
I still hate the nights.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:16.150
Being alone in the dark
makes me remember many things.

00:19:17.192 --> 00:19:22.027
It brings back all of those terrible
memories. I don't want to be alone.

00:19:23.999 --> 00:19:26.991
Shurei, could you
play the erhu for me?

00:19:40.983 --> 00:19:43.975
Shurei, your erhu is like a pearl.

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:47.314
So gentle,
it warms my heart.

00:20:07.509 --> 00:20:09.477
Ryuki! How are you feeling?!

00:20:10.479 --> 00:20:11.912
I'm all right now.

00:20:12.047 --> 00:20:13.412
Thank goodness.

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:17.079
- What's this?
- Actually...

00:20:17.152 --> 00:20:19.347
...I had planned to give it
to you yesterday.

00:20:19.421 --> 00:20:21.889
Wh-Why, this is...!

00:20:22.324 --> 00:20:25.350
One of these would fetch enough
to build two or three warehouses!

00:20:25.861 --> 00:20:27.260
Is that so?

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:31.261
Honestly...
Well anyway, thank you.

00:20:36.004 --> 00:20:37.266
Does it suit me?

00:20:38.774 --> 00:20:40.264
You look beautiful.

00:20:40.909 --> 00:20:42.638
Wh-What are you saying?

00:20:42.711 --> 00:20:47.739
From now on, can I come
and listen to you play the erhu?

00:20:48.917 --> 00:20:50.942
You can't sleep alone, right?

00:20:51.954 --> 00:20:53.922
I suppose it can't be helped.

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:00.492
Koyu Ri, Shuei Ran.

00:21:03.832 --> 00:21:06.926
The king has sent me
to give these to you two.

00:21:09.771 --> 00:21:12.831
- The king sent these to us?
- Yes.

00:21:13.308 --> 00:21:18.041
Well, well. This is really something.
I never expected it to come to this.

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:23.615
But do you usually use fresh flowers?
That's so vague.

00:21:24.019 --> 00:21:28.046
I said the same thing to the king,
but he said it was urgent...

00:21:28.123 --> 00:21:30.853
...and told me to pick them myself
and deliver them to you.

00:21:30.926 --> 00:21:36.523
Urgent? I see. In which case,
I shall judge this favorably.

00:21:39.468 --> 00:21:41.060
What about you?

00:21:43.472 --> 00:21:46.498
Please tell the king that we've
accepted the flowers.

00:21:46.608 --> 00:21:47.666
Yes.

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:56.010
Honestly, I didn't expect you
to accept it without reservation.

00:21:56.251 --> 00:22:02.121
To accept a flower from the king
is to vow loyalty to the king.

00:22:03.191 --> 00:22:07.093
But I didn't expect him to give us irises,
so I figured, why not?

00:22:08.230 --> 00:22:14.032
The iris. It carries the meaning
"I put my faith in you".

00:22:14.236 --> 00:22:17.171
What's more, the flowers are purple,
the color of the royal family.

00:22:17.239 --> 00:22:19.673
That's pretty clever of him to use a
flower that conveys a double meaning...

00:22:19.741 --> 00:22:22.539
...don't you think?
- Yeah.

00:22:33.588 --> 00:22:36.421
Come to think of it,
how did he know...

00:22:36.491 --> 00:22:41.053
...that there was poison in that wine
before he drank it? Could it be...?

00:22:41.763 --> 00:22:47.201
This guy has exceptional observation
skills? No, it's not just that.

00:22:48.303 --> 00:22:50.464
During Koyu's lessons...

00:22:51.106 --> 00:22:53.870
...he's never fazed
by even the hardest questions...

00:22:54.543 --> 00:22:56.238
...and he seems to raise
insightful opinions...

00:22:56.311 --> 00:22:58.370
...when he speaks
during court sessions.

00:23:00.982 --> 00:23:03.246
Why didn't I notice it earlier?

00:23:03.819 --> 00:23:08.017
Ryuki is not some stupid king.
He's just pretending to be one.

00:23:08.557 --> 00:23:09.854
But why?

00:23:11.259 --> 00:23:16.322
That's it! He finds it amusing
watching me try so hard!

00:23:22.104 --> 00:23:23.571
Wake up, Ryuki!

00:23:23.805 --> 00:23:25.830
Wha... What are you doing?!

00:23:25.907 --> 00:23:28.432
I'm doing this!

00:23:30.612 --> 00:23:35.709
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.851 --> 00:23:42.415
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.524 --> 00:23:47.587
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.696 --> 00:23:52.690
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.768 --> 00:23:58.228
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.774 --> 00:24:04.905
You are just like me

00:24:05.647 --> 00:24:10.175
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.252 --> 00:24:16.157
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.125 --> 00:24:22.927
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.031 --> 00:24:27.900
I will always think of you

00:24:29.037 --> 00:24:41.711
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

